<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Elco Q4 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Israel's Elco Q4 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elco Holdings Ltd's results as reported to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>		     (in thousands of shekels except per share data)</p>
<p>			  Q4 96	Q4 95	12-MTH 96  12-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		 720,078    792,502    3,405,219  3,420,111</p>
<p>Pretax profit	   3,583     23,574	135,789    184,273</p>
<p>Net Profit	 loss 3,516     14,379	 51,941     96,590</p>
<p>EPS (shekels)    loss 0.46	 1.91	   6.93	12.87</p>
<p>($1 = 3.25 shekels on Dec 31)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
